      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `normalize_expense.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external provider for normalizing expense fields into a standard JSON schema. I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. This service can be used to normalize and extract relevant information from expense fields. </thinking>\n",
