    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `extract_receipt_fields.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external provider for extracting fields from a receipt. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR service provided by AWS for extracting text and data from documents. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the use of the `textract` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863163498,
          "start": 1789863159764
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2867d4001oiHegSdxhT5hWb",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc286243001WAQ1BKMflKFWLf",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d79dcdffepNuRSnF3ZdW9JL",
