    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file 'extract_invoice_fields.py' that extracts vendor, date, total, and line-item fields from an invoice, I need to choose a concrete external provider for document extraction. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice as it provides robust document processing capabilities. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to integrate with Amazon Textract. The code will include the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Amazon Textract client to perform the extraction. </thinking>\n",
